pplied by the factory."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass its factory explicitly; global "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap"},{"type":"text","text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Traffic logging","anchor":"Traffic-logging"},{"code":["Logging.configure(logLevel: .trace)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YubiKit to be compiled with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"warning","name":"Warning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Custom backends","anchor":"Custom-backends"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Labels identify categories, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key=value"},{"type":"text","text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose YubiKit’s log level and backend with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logging\/configure(logLevel:factory:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit":{"url":"\/documentation\/yubikit","role":"collection","title":"YubiKit","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"documentation-header.png"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Connect and run commands on the different applications on a YubiKey. The framework support connecting using NFC, Lightning and USB.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit","kind":"symbol"},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/Logging/configure(logLevel:factory:)":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logging\/configure(logLevel:factory:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets YubiKit’s log level and backend."}],"title":"conf